                                ; LDFASTB.ASM 
                                ; 
                                ; Implements fast-boot. Fast boot is a method o
				f booting involving a pack file, containing a b
				lob containing KERNEL, GDI, and USER, 
                                ; and an overlay, containing the options the us
				er selected in setup. 
                                ; this is primarily done in order to speed up b
				oot on very slow systems booting from MFM disks
				 or even floppies, as it's always fast
				
                                ; than many small files 
                                ; 
                                ; ---------------------------------------------
				------------------------------ 
